.env*
!.env.example

# Docs and agent/project notes
docs
README.md
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md

# Orchestration files are not needed inside the build stages
compose.yaml
compose.local.yaml
Caddyfile.local
Dockerfile
realtime/Dockerfile

# OS noise
.DS_Store
